Node ID=03 Fixt the camp is quiet
Text=The camp has gone quiet. No shouting, no ogres at the fence, and nobody has come for the sheep. I have been a prisoner long enough to distrust quiet. What has happened out there?
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=The titans have gone. All of them. You are free to go.
