Node ID=04 Fixt free to go
Text=Gone? Walked away, with nobody dead at the fence? <He grips the rail for a moment.> I will not ask what you said to them. I have a wife in Montaillou who thinks I am a dead man, and I intend to correct her.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then go. I will see you in Montaillou.
