Node ID=30 Lucius
Text=Bah, it was that fool Alexander. He lived on a secluded farm outside of town. In the days before the monsters came, he was boasting that he had a secret friend who could do the work of a dozen men.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=32 Lucius 2
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=32 Lucius 2
Text=Alexander was a great lover of wine, and could frequently be found at the bottom of a bottle. Nobody gave the slightest thought to his stories. It wasn't until a couple of days ago that we realized he must have been talking about a titan. By then it was too late.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do you mean "too late"?
Go to node ID=34 Alexander eaten

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Have you tried talking to the titans?
Go to node ID=34 Don't talk to monsters
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=34 Alexander eaten
Text=Alexander's was one of the first bodies found half-eaten by these blue monsters and their ogres. His "secret friend" must have been their scout. The blood of the dead of Montaillou are on that damn fool's hands. 
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Are you sure he was eaten by the titans?
